        {
            "sentence_index": 7,
            "timestamp": {
                "start": 45.64,
                "end": 60.3
            },
            "transcript": "The latter, though in the experimental stage, as far back as the American Revolution, have in this bitter contest, then for the first time brought to so practical a stage of development, as to exert a really appreciable influence on the outcome of the struggle.",
