        {
            "sentence_index": 8,
            "timestamp": {
                "start": 61.5,
                "end": 70.44
            },
            "transcript": "Comparatively, few people appreciate how the thought of navigating the air's disious tides and the seas glumious depths has obsessed the minds of inventors.",
