                "happy": 0.14590847271460722,
                "neutral": 0.15917713823177704,
                "sad": 0.10251814499589959,
                "surprised": 0.11384114384698604
            }
        },
        {
            "sentence_index": 10,
            "timestamp": {
                "start": 85.17999999999999,
                "end": 102.48
            },
            "transcript": "The men who really gave practical effect to the vague theories which others set up, in aircraft the rights, Santos, Dumont, and Count Zeppelin, and submarines, Lake and Holland, are either still living or have died so recently that their memory is still fresh in the minds of all.",
