                "sad": 0.10595372516106681,
                "surprised": 0.11265954329801743
            }
        },
        {
            "sentence_index": 12,
            "timestamp": {
                "start": 111.16,
                "end": 123.0
            },
            "transcript": "He has collated from the immense mass of records of the activities of both submarines and aircraft, enough interesting data to show the degree of perfection and practical ability to which both have been brought.",
